<Base><section class="section"><p class="eyebrow">How we work</p><h1>Know the environment.<br>Watch the signals.<br>Own the follow-through.</h1><p class="lead">Engineers use shared environment records to assess signals, escalate investigations and track follow-up.</p><p>Automated monitoring can surface issues continuously. Human coverage and response commitments depend on the service agreement.</p></section><Workflow id="how-workflow" /><section class="section light"><div class="split"><div><span class="illustrative-badge">Illustrative</span><h2>Daily checks.<br />Questions behind the work.</h2><p>These examples explain what a review can consider. They contain no client records, real alerts or promised schedule.</p></div><DailyChecks /></div></section></Base>
